                  <nc xml:id="m-2d3c7814-b8b4-498e-9b78-7224637c7d35" pname="f" oct="3" /></neume></syllable><divLine xml:id="m-7ffc09fc-be67-4ab0-a46b-2ea67671f3c7" facs="#m-beea4a03-6b7d-46c9-a428-41c2e797dc1a" form="finalis" /></layer></staff><div xml:id="m-e8627809-100f-4130-b678-2e837e4754dd"><lg xml:id="m-f5bbac02-c653-46c1-ac3f-2379457362f4"><l xml:id="m-32f62c38-f894-4a75-a26c-0be64006eac2" facs="#m-82cb6f1e-9b8a-4594-b0be-64bd678eddfe" label="ambiguous">1714</l><l xml:id="m-ffb9ce12-e27a-4717-931d-315d889e2421" facs="#m-093d40b7-4009-45d1-9e9c-76cdf8516170" label="text-like">Feast of our Lord Jesus Christ, King¬</l><l xml:id="m-a2989af2-db0b-497b-82b7-cc796ca6b38a" facs="#m-24268ec4-46c4-4e4e-9767-60f16f5f1bc7" label="ambiguous">comm.E</l><l xml:id="m-dd0777a7-dce5-46bd-8afb-017825b128f7" facs="#m-8120aad0-b3a3-4cd3-92df-1d889fd93f96" label="ambiguous">6.</l><l xml:id="m-64b7f8a2-fe1c-4701-9c4e-ffbf5a0d6d80" facs="#m-4e76de39-217c-4445-93e3-0a87807710cd" label="lyrics-like">Edébit “ Dóminus Rex in ae- térnum: Dóminus</l><l xml:id="m-cc4d3543-9641-460e-9810-ba345430f21e" facs="#m-cae0287c-b5f5-4813-9b64-9f90e28889a7" label="lyrics-like">benedí-cet pópu-lo sú¬</l><l xml:id="m-d80c8f09-aed1-4823-bcf4-c0b796d4535c" facs="#m-f509bc7e-c68c-4fce-bb03-eae32cce1c4f" label="lyrics-like">in pá-ce.</l><l xml:id="m-119169dc-2550-4a24-a50b-6aeaf16b93e3" facs="#m-b33dbd1f-3485-455f-8bc8-bdc0476c11e1" label="ambiguous">Postcommunion.</l><l xml:id="m-2b5a4034-e533-4152-8cae-091d57c4d362" facs="#m-a91d13c6-e871-4563-b1e0-732231785874" label="lyrics-like">Mmortalitátis alimóniam conse- târe gloriámur, cum Ipso, in caelé¬</l><l xml:id="m-70875068-899f-4e3f-a12e-e2b6274cc79e" facs="#m-4ba1a082-cb83-461e-a5a6-71938e656b68" label="lyrics-like">A cúti, quaésumus, Dómine: ut sti sede, júgiter regnâre possímus:</l><l xml:id="m-27a76d0a-fc40-4d48-bf3e-f4e48cef3c23" facs="#m-bdefe6bf-c2cd-4608-abae-5916704cc9bd" label="ambiguous">qui sub Christi Regis vexillis mili-Qui tecum.</l><l xml:id="m-0bd8d2e7-4a4d-414d-87a5-15fdd5b7191b" facs="#m-c471ebd8-f239-4ccc-b08d-06f43a93cefb" label="text-like">Commemoration of the Sunday. The last Gospel is that of the Sunday.</l><l xml:id="m-8f1d8068-7c7e-4ec0-b78c-0608a1f22c07" facs="#m-1534b0cf-e929-4394-81d2-2b20e031215a" label="text-like">AT SEXT.</l><l xml:id="m-f3a8fabc-9b2b-4bba-9407-ee721408ddcb" facs="#m-966470fb-97e9-4424-9049-dc720f1bf189" label="lyrics-like">Ant. Exsbunt áquae. p. 1706.</l><l xml:id="m-929f80c5-a4d7-485c-9c62-b0d66f2e4506" facs="#m-095aecdc-a66a-4eea-8ddc-ec64dac8c5ed" label="ambiguous">Chapter.</l><l xml:id="m-0bf37801-a71e-43b1-a716-a7715a160193" facs="#m-b8ba8737-0c63-49e2-bf77-348c12785411" label="ambiguous">Coloss. 1.</l><l xml:id="m-550a2135-d38a-4e5c-ba8d-d6cbf3566d5c" facs="#m-359a5736-30d5-4f45-b151-467defa5b72f" label="lyrics-like">Mnia per ipsum et in ipso creáta (est principium, primogénitus ex</l><l xml:id="m-49ff586f-f54c-408a-8986-1eb38a9ccb46" facs="#m-46dde7d5-6104-4719-ba31-6aa3f4b101a3" label="lyrics-like">U sunt, et ipse est ante omnes, et l mórtuis, *ut sit in ómnibus ipse</l><l xml:id="m-4d842be9-19c5-47c5-b8b2-90d6ea910562" facs="#m-c2a02a4f-077b-42e0-9329-7d34cc6d6e49" label="lyrics-like">ómnia in ipso constant. ! Et ipse primátum tenens. H. Deo grátiãs.</l><l xml:id="m-fb2c170b-d0f1-42f6-a244-186db90610f5" facs="#m-8addfbfd-9989-4bd3-b95a-455af02bb020" label="lyrics-like">est caput córporis Écelésiae, qui</l><l xml:id="m-8bfc62ad-0565-4ddb-b67c-c482d589d0b9" facs="#m-78d8c71a-0711-4322-b02a-421164683d8a" label="ambiguous">short</l><l xml:id="m-6676abdc-c217-46ad-8311-ee15be058a76" facs="#m-169a2b17-5931-4635-b22d-7b7fe71ae4a9" label="ambiguous">Resp.</l><l xml:id="m-9cdcda34-c980-49d0-acb1-4a5cb8ea8ae3" facs="#m-8a5ba46d-0c36-4d87-b655-72a201ef6f82" label="ambiguous">.</l><l xml:id="m-ea516baa-e92c-4d36-80bb-a3590aa9df63" facs="#m-c2fdb0da-8c69-41a0-b379-a7ecf58d759e" label="ambiguous">★</l><l xml:id="m-254943cc-a736-41e8-8f54-cf1d42c97e38" facs="#m-d831a64a-60e0-463f-9dd9-336433c58379" label="ambiguous">"</l><l xml:id="m-7ab953ad-4ffe-4585-9053-5e221a2b13c0" facs="#m-8f2acb2b-c876-4f62-8cad-a512c7ce37de" label="lyrics-like">Fférte Dómino,“Famí-li-ae populó-rum. Affér¬</l><l xml:id="m-b40321b9-8fb2-44e6-8207-b850b7a8b76a" facs="#m-50c591ff-3e42-42e5-a17c-3fdde7143ac9" label="lyrics-like">te. V. Afférte Dómino glóri-am et impé-ri-um. Famí¬</l><l xml:id="m-5ed820a6-303b-4657-96ef-f5bba8cbe17e" facs="#m-3d61101e-b282-466e-b0a2-05cadc11b142" label="lyrics-like">li-ae. Gló-ri-a Pátri. Afférte.</l><l xml:id="m-1099cb55-3a99-4bd1-bc00-c340be375230" facs="#m-db4617b8-f3d8-4579-8ce1-20aefe95d649" label="lyrics-like">V. Adorábunt éum ómnes réges térrae.</l><l xml:id="m-17d10910-5c63-476d-8484-d490531f4784" facs="#m-21cc73ad-dc0e-45a3-a2ba-b908d58157f2" label="lyrics-like">R. Omnes Géntes sérvient éi.</l><l xml:id="m-ec9b9ebb-1cb0-42d6-9b72-c12916e738bd" facs="#m-ec7499d8-cca4-4ec6-836e-d2b3e1bd9add" label="text-like">AT NONE.</l><l xml:id="m-01ea8a35-2956-4ea6-82fe-1ac6ad85374f" facs="#m-dcce88c4-03e9-4af6-9d96-0a39f079b500" label="lyrics-like">Ant. Gens et régnum. p. 176.</l><l xml:id="m-26d9f5d1-1974-4131-82ce-7b059b954184" facs="#m-c5e2bcb9-a4af-4add-8c20-009f064dbb6c" label="ambiguous">Chapter.</l><l xml:id="m-676b9e89-8f86-4786-bbfa-01626e8e0d1f" facs="#m-2f972f9f-a8e7-4ed7-8021-9494df811b7e" label="ambiguous">Coloss. I.</l><l xml:id="m-d3b999a0-905a-4247-8e74-1fb4b502d26d" facs="#m-ad982db9-3876-4d3c-a29c-b6710dcd6da8" label="lyrics-like">N ipso complácuit omnem pleni- sive quae in terris, sive quae in</l><l xml:id="m-89a0fc03-625c-41b1-9216-ea1b562eab75" facs="#m-10df9ce7-551e-4ba0-b5f1-17e4e4ce2808" label="lyrics-like">L túdinem inhabitáre, t et per eum</l><l xml:id="m-b3e6cb70-4f4f-4e84-8437-b2bed8f143d9" facs="#m-fd6c6487-cd71-46d5-8af1-5643703e280c" label="lyrics-like">caelis sunt, in Christo Jesu Dómino</l><l xml:id="m-5e01e471-bb71-461e-96b9-745893b91826" facs="#m-6258dbcb-80e7-48c6-829f-f04ffccfa017" label="lyrics-like">nostro. R. Deo grátias.</l><l xml:id="m-1732cb89-a51d-4f65-b76f-72415a306e55" facs="#m-5003c86e-ee3b-4a7b-948b-462a2b8fa9e9" label="lyrics-like">reconciliâre ómnia in ipsum, * pa¬</l><l xml:id="m-af350229-4fbb-4818-9946-f98566bb2f13" facs="#m-4a45ae11-7097-4f89-a0fb-13e596db42f6" label="lyrics-like">cíficans per sánguinem crucis ejus,</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
